  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Healing Poultice"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "When combined with a paste made of certain plants and flowers, "
        },
        {
          "text": "Vinteum",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " appears to bring out miraculous wound-cleaning properties. There is one specific flower, "
        },
        {
          "text": "Aum",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", that can be used without Vinteum, as it already contains easily accessible healing properties of its own. \n\nApplying this mixture to the body and holding it in place causes a slow release of healing magic that can restore even the most serious of wounds... if given enough time. \n\nUnfortunately, "
        },
        {
          "text": "any upset to the body (like sudden movements or being injured) disrupts the slow release of magical healing",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " from the poultice and renders it useless, ending the effect."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
